  "summary": "Hood (bonnet) assembly with its hinges, hood support struts (props), hood-side lock covers (the catch plates that engage the hood locks of A7), the cable tying the LH and RH covers together, and the hood weatherstrip. Covers are screwed to the hood underside; hinges are screwed to the body over shims; supports are screwed to the hood at the top and to a body bracket at the bottom; the cable ends attach to each cover with clevis pin, washer and cotter pin, and the cable is held mid-hood by a clip and screw. Weatherstrip is cemented on. Related: A7 (hood lock & release).",
